{"arguments":{"at":"end","doc":"d1","markdown":"## Review summary\n\n- Accepted (Alice Moreau): \"Team leads should agree\" became \"Team leads must agree\".\n- Accepted (Alice Moreau): deleted \"Outside core hours, employees choose when they work.\"\n- Accepted (Alice Moreau): added \"Report a lost device to the service desk within 24 hours.\"\n- Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): \"up to three days a week\" changed to \"up to five days a week\".\n- Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): the furniture allowance changed from EUR 300 to EUR 750.\n- Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): deleted \"Use the company VPN on every network outside the office.\"\n"},"at":8,"case":"transcripts/w5-selective-review#1","event":"call","outputs":[],"result":{"app":{"changed_parts":[{"doc":"d1","part":"[Content_Types].xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/_rels/document.xml.rels"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/document.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/numbering.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/people.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/styles.xml"}],"touched":[{"doc":"d1","part":"[Content_Types].xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/_rels/document.xml.rels"},{"blocks":["p:6A70E1A8","p:73D22116"],"doc":"d1","heading":"p:6A70E1A8","level":2,"part":"word/document.xml"},{"blocks":["p:248828D0","p:27E7AE38"],"doc":"d1","heading":"p:248828D0","level":2,"part":"word/document.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/numbering.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/people.xml"},{"doc":"d1","part":"word/styles.xml"}]},"changed":[],"checks":{"reflow":{"changed":[1],"pages":[1,1]},"validate":{"baseline":0,"fixed":[],"new":[]}},"created":["p:248828D0","p:4D332FBE","p:1234B65C","p:36070FA6","p:07C803C5","p:60298A4C","p:27E7AE38"],"data":{"blocks":["p:248828D0","p:4D332FBE","p:1234B65C","p:36070FA6","p:07C803C5","p:60298A4C","p:27E7AE38"]},"doc":"d1","next_cursor":null,"ok":true,"removed":[],"renamed":{},"summary":"Inserted 7 block(s)","version":3,"warnings":["style added: List Bullet (ListBullet), as Word writes it"]},"tool":"word_insert_markdown"}
{"arguments":{"doc":"d1","view":"markup"},"at":9,"case":"transcripts/w5-selective-review#1","event":"call","outputs":[],"result":{"app":{},"changed":[],"checks":{},"created":[],"data":"<!-- p:5FCB534E -->\n# Remote Working Guideline\n\n<!-- p:4C32E1FB -->\n## Eligibility\n\n<!-- p:16425160 -->\nEmployees who have completed their probation period may work remotely up to three days a week. Team leads must agree a schedule with each employee.\n\n<!-- p:3B212964 -->\n## Equipment\n\n<!-- p:12972045 -->\nThe company provides {--a laptop and a headset--}<!-- rev:11 Chen Wei -->{++a laptop, a headset and a monitor++}<!-- rev:12 Chen Wei -->. Employees can claim up to EUR 300 for office furniture once every three years.\n\n<!-- p:4B50F4CD -->\n## Working hours\n\n<!-- p:77B9C794 -->\nCore hours are 10:00 to 15:00.\n\n<!-- p:69E36C9F -->\n## Security\n\n<!-- p:058B17C9 -->\nUse the company VPN on every network outside the office. Do not print confidential documents at home. Report a lost device to the service desk within 24 hours.\n\n<!-- p:6A70E1A8 -->\n## Expenses\n\n<!-- p:73D22116 -->\nInternet costs are covered by a monthly allowance of {--EUR 25--}<!-- rev:9 Chen Wei -->{++EUR 30++}<!-- rev:10 Chen Wei -->.{++¶++}<!-- rev:27 Claude -->\n\n<!-- p:248828D0 -->\n## {++Review summary++}<!-- rev:13 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:14 Claude -->\n\n- {++Accepted (Alice Moreau): \"Team leads should agree\" became \"Team leads must agree\".++}<!-- rev:15 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:16 Claude --> <!-- p:4D332FBE -->\n- {++Accepted (Alice Moreau): deleted \"Outside core hours, employees choose when they work.\"++}<!-- rev:17 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:18 Claude --> <!-- p:1234B65C -->\n- {++Accepted (Alice Moreau): added \"Report a lost device to the service desk within 24 hours.\"++}<!-- rev:19 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:20 Claude --> <!-- p:36070FA6 -->\n- {++Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): \"up to three days a week\" changed to \"up to five days a week\".++}<!-- rev:21 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:22 Claude --> <!-- p:07C803C5 -->\n- {++Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): the furniture allowance changed from EUR 300 to EUR 750.++}<!-- rev:23 Claude -->{++¶++}<!-- rev:24 Claude --> <!-- p:60298A4C -->\n- {++Rejected (Bob Lindqvist): deleted \"Use the company VPN on every network outside the office.\"++}<!-- rev:25 Claude --> <!-- p:27E7AE38 rev:28 paragraph-properties Claude -->\n","doc":"d1","next_cursor":null,"ok":true,"removed":[],"renamed":{},"summary":"Read the document (markup)","total":2141,"version":3,"warnings":[]},"tool":"word_read"}
